l},{"k":"69:43","t":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"69:44","t":"And if he [i.e., Muḥammad] had made up about Us some [false] sayings,","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"69:45","t":"We would have seized him by the right hand;","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"69:46","t":"Then We would have cut from him the aorta.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"69:47","t":"And there is no one of you who could prevent [Us] from him.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"69:48","t":"And indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a reminder for the righteous.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"69:49","t":"And indeed, We know that among you are deniers.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"69:50","t":"And indeed, it will be [a cause of] regret upon the disbelievers.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"69:51","t":"And indeed, it is the truth of certainty.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"69:52","t":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"70:1","t":"A supplicant asked for a punishment bound to happen","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"70:2","t":"To the disbelievers; of it there is no preventer.","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"70:3","t":"[It is] from Allāh, owner of the ways of ascent.","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"70:4","t":"The angels and the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] will ascend to Him during a Day the extent of which is fifty thousand years.","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"70:5","t":"So be patient with gracious patience.","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"70:6","t":"Indeed, they see it [as] distant,","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"70:7","t":"But We see it [as] near.","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"70:8","t":"On the Day the sky will be like murky oil,","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"70:9","t":"And the mountains will be like wool,","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"70:10","t":"And no friend will ask [anything of] a friend,","j":29,"h":57,"s":70,"a":10,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":57,"surahs":[69,70],"sajdah":false}